",RandomUtilTest::randomNumber_1_oe,org.springside.modules.utils.number.RandomUtil,int nextInt(0),"返回0到Intger.MAX_VALUE的随机Int, 使用内置全局普通Random."
springside4_145_2,"	@Test
	public void randomNumber_2_oe() {

		int i = RandomUtil.nextInt();
		// removed other assertion
		i = RandomUtil.nextInt(RandomUtil.threadLocalRandom());
		assertThat(i).isBetween(0, Integer.MAX_VALUE);
	}
",RandomUtilTest::randomNumber_2_oe,org.springside.modules.utils.number.RandomUtil,Random threadLocalRandom(0),"随机数工具集.

1. 获取无锁的ThreadLocalRandom, 性能较佳的SecureRandom

2. 保证没有负数陷阱，也能更精确设定范围的nextInt/nextLong/nextDouble (copy from Common Lang
RandomUtils，但默认使用性能较优的ThreadLocalRandom，并可配置其他的Random)

3. 随机字符串

